---
import SeoPage from '../../layouts/SeoPage.astro';
import { competitors, verifiedLabel } from '../../facts/seo-facts.mjs';

const ff = competitors.fireflies;
const others = ['otter', 'fathom', 'read-ai', 'tldv', 'granola'].map((s) => competitors[s]);
const faq = [
  {
    q: 'Is there a free alternative to Fireflies?',
    a: 'Several. Fireflies has a free plan itself, and Otter, Fathom, Read AI, tl;dv and Granola each list a free plan with their own limits. OpenMinutes is free software you run yourself, but you pay for the server and for your AI provider.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is OpenMinutes really free?',
    a: 'The software is free under AGPL-3.0 with no licence key. Running it costs a machine and whatever your AI provider charges, unless you transcribe locally. If you do not want to run it, hosting starts at EUR 9 a month.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What do I give up compared with Fireflies?',
    a: 'Zoom support, ready-made integrations such as CRM and Slack, bot-free capture, a managed service and vendor compliance reports. OpenMinutes is also early-stage.',
  },
];
---

<SeoPage
  title="Free Fireflies alternative: self-hosted vs free plan | OpenMinutes"
  description="Free Fireflies alternative? The free plans of Fireflies, Otter, Fathom, Read AI, tl;dv and Granola next to OpenMinutes, which you self-host. Limits, with sources."
  h1="A free alternative to Fireflies"
  lede="Fireflies has a free plan, and so do others. If your goal is to avoid per-seat fees or to keep the data yourself, the free options differ in ways that matter."
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Alternatives', path: '/compare' }, { name: 'Free Fireflies alternative', path: '/alternatives/free-fireflies-alternative' }]}
  {faq}
  verified
  related={[
    { href: '/compare/fireflies', label: 'OpenMinutes vs Fireflies.ai' },
    { href: '/compare', label: 'All comparisons' },
    { href: '/hosting', label: 'Hosted OpenMinutes' },
    { href: '/docs/getting-started', label: 'Install OpenMinutes' },
  ]}
>
  <h2>The free options, as of {verifiedLabel}</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="wide-table">
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Option</th><th scope="col">What the free tier is</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row"><a href="/compare/fireflies">{ff.name}</a></th>
          <td>{ff.rows.free.value} {ff.rows.free.src.map((u: string, i: number) => <a class="src" href={u} rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">[{i + 1}]</a>)}</td>
        </tr>
        {
          others.map((c: any) => (
            <tr>
              <th scope="row"><a href={`/compare/${c.slug}`}>{c.name}</a></th>
              <td>{c.rows.free.value} {c.rows.free.src.map((u: string, i: number) => <a class="src" href={u} rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">[{i + 1}]</a>)}</td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
        <tr>
          <th scope="row"><a href="/use/self-hosted-ai-meeting-notetaker">OpenMinutes</a></th>
          <td>Free software, no limits set by us. You pay for the machine and your own AI provider, or transcribe locally. Pre-release.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>What "free" costs with OpenMinutes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A machine that runs Docker: about 1 vCPU and 1.5 GB of RAM for each meeting recorded at once, plus a small base (<a href="/docs/sizing">sizing</a>).</li>
    <li>Transcription: free with local Whisper on your CPU, or at your provider's rate. The docs list $0.04 to $0.36 per audio hour in October 2026 (<a href="/docs/providers">providers</a>).</li>
    <li>Your time: setup, updates and backups.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>If you want the same software run for you, <a href="/hosting">hosting is EUR 9, 20 or 59 a month</a> for 1, 3 or 10 concurrent meetings.</p>

  <h2>When not to choose OpenMinutes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You use Zoom, or need CRM, Slack and other integrations out of the box.</li>
    <li>You do not want to run or pay for a server and an AI provider.</li>
    <li>You need a bot-free option, or vendor audit reports.</li>
    <li>You need something stable today: OpenMinutes is pre-release, with no published image yet.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Full details: <a href="/compare/fireflies">OpenMinutes vs Fireflies.ai</a>.</p>
</SeoPage>
